<h2 id="toc0"><span>Expert</span></h2>
<p>The Expert is a master of certain tasks or knowledge, favoring cunning over brawn. It might be a scout, a musician, a librarian, a clever street kid, a wily merchant or a burglar.</p>
<p>To gain the expert class, a creature must have at least one language in its stat block that it can speak.</p>
<p>A NPC gains the following class features as it gains levels, as summarized on the Expert table.</p>
